!! Prior-art sources

* Bazel, Test Encyclopedia — hermetic test inputs, runner environment, private temp paths and cleanup: https://bazel.build/reference/test-encyclopedia
* Vitest, Parallelism and Parallel/Sequential Test Files — isolation and shared-resource scheduling: https://vitest.dev/guide/parallelism · https://vitest.dev/guide/recipes/parallel-sequential.html
* Node.js `net.Server.listen` — OS-assigned port behavior: https://nodejs.org/api/net.html#serverlistenport-host-backlog-callback
* Docker Compose project names and services `ports` — project resource isolation and host/container port mapping: https://docs.docker.com/compose/how-tos/project-name/ · https://docs.docker.com/compose/intro/compose-application-model/ · https://docs.docker.com/reference/compose-file/services/#ports
* pnpm recursive commands — dependency topology and workspace concurrency: https://pnpm.io/cli/recursive
* SLSA v1.2 Provenance — build outputs, materials, and process provenance: https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/provenance

